    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i get that but i really dont want to go to the doctor right now, it's way too expensive and i'm pretty sure it's just regular gastritis. if i take the ibuprofen with a big glass of milk or maybe even some food it'll protect my stomach, right? like, would that make it okay to just take the 800mg dose so i can sleep? i just need someone to tell me it's fine for a one-time thing.",
